QGIS contributors. QGIS Training Manual. [Official maintained entry](https://docs.qgis.org/latest/en/docs/training_manual/index.html) · [Version 3.44 manual reached during checking](https://docs.qgis.org/3.44/en/docs/training_manual/index.html).

Complete the basic-map, vector/attribute, layout, data-creation, projection, analysis, raster/terrain, and assessment modules. During advanced work read the processing/log/model and georeferencing material needed to reconstruct a workflow. Match commands and tools to the exact installed version rather than assuming the current entry remains fixed.

The earlier 3.40 page stated end of life and linked to the maintained entry, which resolved to 3.44 during checking. The official manual is freely accessible; consult its actual documentation/software and component licences before adapting or distributing it. Documentation structure/version and access checked on 29 October 2026. No QGIS dependency, plugin, map service, or training dataset is bundled or required as a new Lince feature.

